# BAUXVI

This is a meta package of only configuration files.

This will have system wide configuation files that:
* Cover EVERY vim variant from neovide neovim all the way down to vi.tiny debian package
* This will have "master" style that is:
  * full blown BAUX/TMUX/BASH maped everything including AI integrations, "NvChad on steroids"
  * it will work in "fall back" mode, so as much of your config as can still works for vi.tiny
